quote:
All areas that were
deemed not suitable for CDM-AR due to the environmental
and land use factors have been excluded a priori from our
analysis. In addition, forested and recently deforested
areas ineligible under current UNFCCC rules were also
excluded:
 drier arid/semi-arid areas with Aridity Index less than
0.65 (AI < 0.65);
 high elevation areas, above 3500 m and/or timberline;
 areas covered by water bodies;
 urban areas;

